        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Effective May 31, 1992, for all employees on the active roll on or after that date, who were laid off and have been rehired by the Company and have prior periods of two (2) years or more net credited service (which is eligible for recognition under the Lucent Technologies Pension Plan upon completion of a two year bridge) that are not yet included in current net credited service, all such prior net credited service will be recognized by the Company for purposes of determining the selection of employees to be laid off (but not for any pension purpose).",
